      "writtenOn": "2019-11-26T23:44:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is the point of this field?  It\u0027s never used, and it\u0027s not actually the padding.  AFAICS, the padding is actually 0-3 bytes between the end of the used portion of \u0027name\u0027 and either the end of ext4_dir_entry_2 or the beginning of ext4_extended_dir_entry_2.",
      "revId": "4233b14c0844411511c826ca32066fc0f3c850d0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ac218de9_a11eec04",
        "filename": "fs/ext4/ext4.h",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 1980,
      "author": {
        "id": 1045980
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-11-28T00:56:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This padding accounts for the space that ext4_extended_dir_entry_2 may occupy, as it is placed immediately after the name, at name[name_len]. Adding in the struct itself would be misleading.",
      "parentUuid": "ed7e3ba0_1f26f6cf",
      "revId": "4233b14c0844411511c826ca32066fc0f3c850d0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
