      "message": "The following would be easier to understand:\n\nreclen \u003d (name_len + 8 + EXT4_DIR_ROUND) \u0026 ~EXT4_DIR_ROUND;\nif (IS_CASEFOLDED(dir) \u0026\u0026 IS_ENCRYPTED(dir))\n        reclen +\u003d sizeof(ext4_extended_dir_entry_2);",
